---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/ui/Button.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Meet Our Founder — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="Ajai Blue-Saunders, Certified Peer Grief Educator and founder of Glorious Health Ministries."
>
  <section class="section stack stack-loose">
    <div class="grid grid-2 about-grid">
      <img
        src="/images/headshot.jpeg"
        alt="Ms. Ajai Blue-Saunders, Certified Peer Grief Educator"
        class="about-photo"
        width="1024"
        height="1024"
      />
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Our Story</p>
        <h1>Ajai Blue-Saunders</h1>
        <p class="kicker kicker-accent">Certified Peer Grief Educator</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stack">
      <p>
        Ajai (A'jay) Blue-Saunders has been involved with program development and nonprofit
        management for over 40 years. She has a background in Grief and Loss gained in her
        educational experience which has been further developed by experiencing the loss of her
        father, mother, older sister, brother, young granddaughter and finally her husband John
        in 2015. Currently she resides in the Metro Richmond, Virginia area with her adult
        daughter with disabilities and together they are learning and attempting to live a
        fulfilled life without him.
      </p>
      <img src="/images/ivy.png" alt="" class="ivy-divider" width="1280" height="640" />
      <p>
        Ajai is a Certified Grief Educator working with women to navigate the ocean of grief
        through strong Christian beliefs and much prayer. She formerly was a peer leader of a
        local widow's support group for over 4 years; an active panelist on community and
        national workshops discussing grief and healing, and she can be found as a presenter on
        the PBS media platform "Speaking Grief" which helps grievers and those supporting those
        in grief.
      </p>
      <img src="/images/ivy.png" alt="" class="ivy-divider" width="1280" height="640" />
      <p>
        As a writer her journey included writing a monthly blog for Hope for Widows Foundation
        for many years and she enjoys sharing wisdom, resources and talents to make the world a
        better place to live and thrive. She has served on the Board of Directors for Hope for
        Widows Foundation for 2 years, helping to strengthen its impact on widows worldwide.
      </p>
      <img src="/images/ivy.png" alt="" class="ivy-divider" width="1280" height="640" />
      <p>
        As a trained and skilled herbalist, she combines her knowledge and experience to
        facilitate workshops using God's herbs to heal and restore widows through the grief
        journey. Her workshops are encouraging, while sensitive to all while she ministers ways
        to heal. Please contact her to arrange for a session/workshop or general grief resources
        and support.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-centered cta-card text-center">
      <p class="cta-card-title">Ready to connect with Ajai?</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <Button href="/contact/" type="button">Contact Ajai</Button>
        <Button href="/gatherings/" type="button" variant="outline">See Upcoming Gatherings</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
